notes.content:
This update has affected almost everything in the game.
[h2]Major changes:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed memory leak on most new computers;
[i] [b] We express our deep gratitude to user [url = https: //steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198371473543] ExiledScythe [/url] for active participation in the search, detailed description and testing of this fatal error in the game. [/b] [/i]
[*] Optimized scene lighting;
[*] Optimized all landscapes, trees, grass, ground textures;
[*] Changed the properties of wind and grass movement;
[*] Removed double damage to towers, as well as damage to them at a great distance;
[*] Fixed a bug with skipping the destruction of a warrior after his death;
[b] [i] We express our gratitude to user [url = https: //steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199090903101/] 𝔇𝔦𝔪𝔢𝔱roniks [/url] for describing and detecting this bug. [/i] [/b]
[*] Fixed a bug with counting the use of cards of warriors and magic;
[*] A lot of minor changes and fixes have been made.
[/list]

At the moment the game is fully functional and playable.
We continue to work on improving the game.

Enjoy the game to all of us. Let there be battle!
